WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.090
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.360 --> 01:41.820
[Episode 31]

3
02:17.440 --> 02:22.864
- Give back our sovereignty! - Give back our sovereignty!

4
02:22.864 --> 02:28.000
Under the pretext of fighting Germany, Japan landed at Longkou, Shandong.

5
02:28.000 --> 02:32.666
They ignored our neutrality and invaded our territory, trampling our nation!

6
02:32.666 --> 02:39.240
- Give back our sovereignty! - Give back our sovereignty!

7
02:39.240 --> 02:40.710
What are you doing?

8
02:40.710 --> 02:42.600
We Japanese have been generous with you.

9
02:42.600 --> 02:45.610
We helped your backward, ignorant country build railways.

10
02:45.610 --> 02:49.060
We even allow you to study advanced knowledge and technology here.

11
02:49.060 --> 02:51.759
Yet instead of being grateful, you slander us.

12
02:51.759 --> 02:53.419
Get lost!

13
03:04.000 --> 03:05.240
Stop fighting!

14
03:05.240 --> 03:08.723
- Stop fighting! - Stop fighting!

15
03:08.723 --> 03:12.153
- Stop fighting! - Stop fighting!

16
03:27.800 --> 03:29.440
- I'll kill you! - Stop!

17
03:33.680 --> 03:37.344
This assembly was approved by the school in advance.

18
03:37.344 --> 03:39.319
It is duly authorized and reasonable.

19
03:39.319 --> 03:42.500
If you want to make trouble, go to the principal's office.

20
03:42.500 --> 03:43.819
So what if we do?

21
03:43.819 --> 03:46.800
You think the principal will side with you Chinese?

22
03:51.000 --> 03:55.620
You may be able to bully a student far from home with no support.

23
03:55.620 --> 03:57.460
But if you dare to despise a nation

24
03:57.460 --> 04:01.000
with 5,000 years of civilization and 400 million people,

25
04:01.000 --> 04:03.097
you will pay a heavy price.

26
04:03.097 --> 04:05.400
And when exactly will we pay that price?

27
04:05.400 --> 04:08.479
Come on! I can't wait.

28
04:09.880 --> 04:11.639
I swear on my life.

29
04:12.659 --> 04:14.000
You will pay for it.

30
04:15.680 --> 04:17.680
Try it if you have the guts.

31
04:17.680 --> 04:19.000
Let's go.

32
04:20.080 --> 04:22.699
Thank you for stepping up.

33
04:22.699 --> 04:26.339
We are all Chinese. We should stick together.

34
04:26.339 --> 04:28.060
- Indeed. - He's right.

35
04:28.060 --> 04:31.200
- We must stick together. - We must stick together.

36
04:31.200 --> 04:32.720
You're badly injured.

37
04:32.720 --> 04:34.650
Let's get you to the infirmary.

38
04:34.650 --> 04:35.951
I'm fine.

39
04:37.120 --> 04:39.360
Who are you? You've got some moves.

40
04:39.360 --> 04:40.480
I'm Yu Ming Xuan.

41
04:40.480 --> 04:42.284
I haven't been in Japan for long.

42
04:42.284 --> 04:43.720
No wonder I haven't seen you before.

43
04:43.720 --> 04:45.320
It's fine that we just met.

44
04:45.320 --> 04:47.581
We're on the same path now.

45
04:57.840 --> 04:59.140
Ming Xuan.

46
05:00.519 --> 05:02.800
"I beg you, one more cup of farewell wine."

47
05:03.636 --> 05:05.483
From tomorrow onwards,

48
05:05.483 --> 05:09.819
I'll have no one here who truly understands me.

49
05:15.399 --> 05:16.699
Zhong Fang.

50
05:17.960 --> 05:20.873
Though miles may part us, we'll meet again.

51
05:21.640 --> 05:24.640
I promise you, once I return,

52
05:24.640 --> 05:27.840
whatever lies ahead, I, Yu Ming Xuan,

53
05:29.720 --> 05:31.690
will never waver in my resolve.

54
05:31.690 --> 05:35.920
To save our nation and to serve the people.

55
05:35.920 --> 05:39.379
We'll never waver, whatever the cost.

56
05:42.120 --> 05:43.700
I'll wait for you in Nanhuai.

57
05:44.680 --> 05:47.259
- It's a deal. - It's a deal.

58
05:55.200 --> 05:57.840
You were the one who made that promise.

59
05:59.560 --> 06:01.946
How could you forget it so easily?

60
06:04.160 --> 06:06.160
Ever since I met you...

61
06:10.840 --> 06:12.993
you were always like this.

62
06:15.840 --> 06:17.619
Always giving,

63
06:20.480 --> 06:22.273
and never asking for anything in return.

64
06:23.320 --> 06:25.859
I always wanted to do something for you.

65
06:26.880 --> 06:30.461
But you had a good family and got along with everyone.

66
06:31.280 --> 06:34.921
And you excelled in your studies.

67
06:36.899 --> 06:39.560
I really didn't know what I could do for you.

68
06:43.240 --> 06:49.199
It wasn't until after you passed away that I found your diary.

69
06:50.120 --> 06:51.957
The 17th day of the Winter Month.

70
06:51.957 --> 06:54.680
The cold in Tokyo has worsened lately.

71
06:54.680 --> 06:56.720
All the leaves in the courtyard have fallen.

72
06:57.500 --> 06:58.899
The 25th day of the Winter Month.

73
06:58.899 --> 07:00.720
I received a letter from Lan Qing.

74
07:00.720 --> 07:02.920
She said everything is fine.

75
07:02.920 --> 07:06.019
But I know she must be braving the cold again

76
07:06.019 --> 07:07.939
to practice her singing early in the morning.

77
07:07.939 --> 07:10.519
She didn't mention her cough in the letter.

78
07:11.399 --> 07:13.480
I'm truly worried about her.

79
07:18.680 --> 07:20.860
I had someone bring this from abroad.

80
07:23.200 --> 07:25.280
It's the brand you used to use.

81
07:27.220 --> 07:28.800
The 5th day of the Spring Month.

82
07:28.800 --> 07:31.180
Had drinks and a long talk with Zhong Fang.

83
07:31.180 --> 07:36.200
When walking on Tokyo's streets at dawn, I thought of Lan Qing's favorite balsam.

84
07:36.200 --> 07:40.650
It sprouts in spring, grows in summer, and withers before autumn.

85
07:40.650 --> 07:44.555
Everything in this world is fleeting, destined to pass away.

86
07:44.555 --> 07:48.750
Yet life keeps growing as it fades.

87
07:48.750 --> 07:50.040
The 8th day of the Early Summer.

88
07:50.040 --> 07:52.443
The reading society is getting busier by the day.

89
07:52.443 --> 07:57.240
In a recent letter from Mother, she said Chang Xuan was mad at Father again.

90
07:57.240 --> 07:59.200
His birthday is coming up.

91
07:59.200 --> 08:04.480
I can't help but wonder if the family has arranged a celebration for him.

92
08:04.480 --> 08:05.960
He likes pocket watches.

93
08:05.960 --> 08:09.604
Before returning to Nanhuai, I must pick one from the watch shop.

94
08:09.604 --> 08:13.240
When his birthday comes, I'll give him a watch he likes.

95
08:13.240 --> 08:15.839
Master Chang Xuan, a birthday gift for you.

96
08:23.040 --> 08:26.353
Jin, how did you know I like pocket watches?

97
08:31.720 --> 08:34.197
I've been chatting with Zhong Fang lately.

98
08:34.197 --> 08:36.920
I find him more and more interesting.

99
08:36.920 --> 08:39.543
Most people crave fame and fortune.

100
08:39.543 --> 08:41.346
[Jin Zhong Fang] Yet he has no interest at all.

101
08:42.713 --> 08:45.440
Sometimes I feel I know him very well.

102
08:45.440 --> 08:48.679
[Jin Zhong Fang] Other times, I can't figure him out.

103
08:48.679 --> 08:51.259
For instance, what does he truly like?

104
08:51.259 --> 08:53.519
I can't say for sure.

105
08:56.520 --> 08:58.220
Ming Xuan.

106
08:58.220 --> 09:03.500
My favorite thing is listening to you talk about your ideals.

107
09:03.500 --> 09:05.299
Zhong Fang!

108
09:05.299 --> 09:06.860
Zhong Fang, good news!

109
09:06.860 --> 09:09.040
Wonderful news!

110
09:09.040 --> 09:11.919
It has begun! The Southwest has risen up!

111
09:11.919 --> 09:12.960
Look!

112
09:13.840 --> 09:16.677
Just today, the Southwest generals sent a telegram nationwide,

113
09:16.677 --> 09:21.040
declaring the Southwest independent and forming an army to overthrow Yan Gong Bao!

114
09:21.040 --> 09:23.517
- Will they really overthrow Yan Gong Bao? - Of course!

115
09:23.517 --> 09:26.419
They've vowed to fight for the dignity of 400 million people.

116
09:26.419 --> 09:28.940
That usurper's dream of becoming emperor is over.

117
09:28.940 --> 09:30.580
The people will not allow it.

118
09:30.580 --> 09:32.040
Our republic is not dead.

119
09:32.040 --> 09:34.080
Our country can still be saved!

120
09:35.840 --> 09:38.840
That's wonderful! Our country can be saved!

121
10:16.940 --> 10:18.320
Who are you?

122
10:18.320 --> 10:19.960
I am Jin Zhong Fang.

123
10:21.320 --> 10:25.940
I was Yu Ming Xuan's... classmate in Japan.

124
10:37.720 --> 10:39.050
He is right inside.

125
10:54.960 --> 10:57.600
[Spirit Tablet of Eldest Brother Yu Ming Xuan]

126
11:39.440 --> 11:43.300
Ming Xuan, your unfinished wishes and ideals,

127
11:44.220 --> 11:46.240
I will fulfill them one by one.

128
12:19.640 --> 12:21.657
Look how eager he is.

129
12:21.657 --> 12:23.978
As if someone's going to take it from him.

130
12:25.280 --> 12:26.720
There, there, Ze Ning.

131
12:26.720 --> 12:28.840
Ze Ning is drinking so well.

132
12:31.040 --> 12:33.960
Ping Jun, give it a try.

133
12:33.960 --> 12:36.324
Here. Support his head with your hand.

134
12:36.324 --> 12:37.324
Be careful.

135
12:39.960 --> 12:41.999
Your other hand, move it up.

136
12:43.600 --> 12:44.600
There.

137
12:51.779 --> 12:54.577
Jin Xuan, he's really drinking.

138
12:54.577 --> 12:56.834
See? I told you you could do it.

139
13:01.640 --> 13:02.900
Gently now.

140
13:05.880 --> 13:08.299
Jin Xuan, is he about to cry?

141
13:08.299 --> 13:11.840
It's alright. Pat him with your hand. Gently.

142
13:11.840 --> 13:13.876
- Pat him gently. - That's it.

143
13:13.876 --> 13:16.799
- Talk to him. - Alright.

144
13:16.799 --> 13:18.519
There, there, Ze Ning.

145
13:19.680 --> 13:20.979
Good boy.

146
13:22.000 --> 13:24.559
Drink up, sweetie.

147
13:24.559 --> 13:26.559
There, there, Ze Ning.

148
13:27.659 --> 13:29.299
There, there.

149
13:56.680 --> 14:00.432
It's so late. Why aren't you asleep?

150
14:00.432 --> 14:02.493
I'll be a while. You go to sleep first.

151
14:09.680 --> 14:12.720
What? Can't sleep without me?

152
14:18.659 --> 14:19.860
I'm not talking to you.

153
15:00.800 --> 15:02.606
Don't be naughty.

154
15:03.840 --> 15:05.059
You get some sleep.

155
15:05.920 --> 15:07.300
I'll take care of the rest.

156
15:57.800 --> 16:02.261
Today, when I saw you holding Ze Ning, you looked so happy.

157
16:04.360 --> 16:05.539
It made me think that

158
16:07.240 --> 16:09.320
we could have a child of our own.

159
16:10.960 --> 16:15.120
A child that looks like both you and me.

160
17:26.600 --> 17:28.000
What are you doing?

161
17:29.660 --> 17:30.799
Nothing.

162
17:30.799 --> 17:34.579
I got Ze Ning a longevity lock to keep him safe.

163
17:36.240 --> 17:39.384
He's too young to wear it yet.

164
17:39.384 --> 17:40.886
Then we'll save it for later.

165
17:46.160 --> 17:50.826
Ze Ning's eyes and nose really look like yours.

166
17:53.400 --> 17:56.561
Of course my child looks like me.

167
18:01.040 --> 18:02.620
Better if he looks like you.

168
18:53.160 --> 18:55.319
Why isn't Uncle back yet?

169
18:56.240 --> 18:59.145
Mr. Tang and Commander Mou are discussing business.

170
18:59.145 --> 19:01.245
They must not be finished yet.

171
19:08.200 --> 19:11.621
About what happened at the lounge that day, thank you.

172
19:13.419 --> 19:14.680
It was nothing.

173
19:14.680 --> 19:18.400
You were injured because of me after all.

174
19:19.880 --> 19:23.779
Next time I see you, Miss Zi Yi, I'll pretend I don't see you.

175
19:25.346 --> 19:26.380
What?

176
19:26.380 --> 19:31.720
You told me to stay out of your business.

177
19:32.960 --> 19:34.566
- I... - Please.

178
19:37.120 --> 19:39.400
I could hear you two talking from a distance.

179
19:39.400 --> 19:43.039
So lively. Like a pair of bickering lovers.

180
19:43.039 --> 19:44.480
Uncle.

181
19:44.480 --> 19:46.680
Mr. Tang, Commander Mou.

182
19:46.680 --> 19:48.420
Xue Ting.

183
19:48.420 --> 19:50.079
What were you talking about?

184
19:50.779 --> 19:53.120
You didn't upset Miss Zi Yi, did you?

185
19:53.120 --> 19:54.719
- Sit down. - I wouldn't dare.

186
19:58.680 --> 20:00.560
This Steinway is a rare find.

187
20:00.560 --> 20:02.437
Commander Mou, you just bought it, right?

188
20:02.437 --> 20:05.460
Dr. Tang's merchant ship just delivered it a few days ago.

189
20:05.460 --> 20:06.660
It's been sitting there unused.

190
20:06.660 --> 20:09.059
Perfect timing. Help me test the sound.

191
20:09.059 --> 20:10.059
Go on.

192
20:10.059 --> 20:12.060
Sure. Let's go.

193
20:55.480 --> 20:57.599
I can't remember the rest.

194
20:58.465 --> 20:59.846
You're still the better pianist.

195
21:01.056 --> 21:03.040
Brahms's Hungarian Dance.

196
21:03.040 --> 21:06.040
It's indeed hard to continue without the sheet music.

197
21:06.799 --> 21:08.220
Xue Ting.

198
21:08.220 --> 21:10.640
Your piano playing is excellent, too.

199
21:10.640 --> 21:13.839
Why don't you play a duet with Miss Zi Yi?

200
21:17.119 --> 21:20.160
Mr. Tang, Commander Mou, since you're in such high spirits,

201
21:20.160 --> 21:21.779
I'll do my humble best.

202
23:28.200 --> 23:29.601
Please sit.

203
23:31.320 --> 23:32.800
Ping Jun.

204
23:36.059 --> 23:38.240
You've lost so much weight.

205
23:39.360 --> 23:40.844
I'm fine.

206
23:40.844 --> 23:45.160
The doctor said withdrawal takes a heavy toll.

207
23:45.160 --> 23:47.660
I'll recover after some rest and nourishment.

208
23:49.140 --> 23:50.353
Please sit.

209
23:56.380 --> 23:57.660
Ping Jun.

210
24:01.859 --> 24:03.140
I'm sorry.

211
24:07.200 --> 24:10.099
I hurt you so much before,

212
24:11.000 --> 24:13.220
yet you put the past aside to help me.

213
24:14.720 --> 24:16.339
Don't say that.

214
24:17.079 --> 24:18.559
It's all in the past.

215
24:25.120 --> 24:30.246
I asked you here today because I want to give you this.

216
24:31.093 --> 24:33.053
It's perfectly round.

217
24:34.280 --> 24:36.039
A symbol of good luck.

218
24:37.960 --> 24:40.080
It's my blessing for you both.

219
24:44.539 --> 24:48.400
Thank you. I love it.

220
24:48.400 --> 24:50.160
I'm glad you like it.

221
24:52.720 --> 24:53.986
Ping Jun,

222
24:54.920 --> 24:58.526
I actually really envy you.

223
24:59.720 --> 25:04.320
In this world, not everyone is lucky enough

224
25:04.320 --> 25:07.280
to spend their life with the one they love.

225
25:10.280 --> 25:12.400
Lan Qing...

226
25:12.400 --> 25:14.340
Don't worry about me.

227
25:15.480 --> 25:19.700
I never thought I'd be so fortunate to find a good man

228
25:19.700 --> 25:24.599
and a love this blessed in my lifetime.

229
25:26.119 --> 25:29.500
But after this near-death experience,

230
25:29.500 --> 25:33.359
I finally realized that Ming Xuan...

231
25:36.819 --> 25:39.119
He's always been right here,

232
25:39.119 --> 25:42.640
watching over me, protecting me.

233
25:45.120 --> 25:49.173
So I will take care of myself

234
25:50.440 --> 25:54.001
and live a good life with his memory in my heart.

235
26:03.560 --> 26:04.919
Look.

236
26:07.160 --> 26:13.020
The plants outside wither and fade when winter arrives.

237
26:14.440 --> 26:16.279
But when spring comes,

238
26:17.440 --> 26:19.640
they sprout and bloom again.

239
26:21.940 --> 26:27.420
Surviving the bitter cold brings new life.

240
26:36.599 --> 26:40.720
Then, what are your plans for the future?

241
26:47.680 --> 26:49.553
I want to leave Nanhuai.

242
26:50.819 --> 26:55.473
I want to go to Beijing or Guangzhou.

243
26:57.120 --> 27:01.840
To see new operas and new scenery.

244
27:04.619 --> 27:06.859
When I return,

245
27:07.560 --> 27:10.013
I'll surely perform even better.

246
27:16.880 --> 27:17.880
Good.

247
27:31.960 --> 27:33.940
Higher, a bit higher.

248
27:33.940 --> 27:35.720
- Hurry up. - The guests will be here soon.

249
27:35.720 --> 27:38.080
You, hang yours higher, too.

250
27:38.080 --> 27:40.360
Move the table here. Put it in the middle.

251
27:41.960 --> 27:44.039
The fruit. Bring the fruit over.

252
27:44.039 --> 27:46.319
Hurry up, you two.

253
27:46.319 --> 27:47.779
What are you all standing around for?

254
27:47.779 --> 27:49.200
Get over there, quickly.

255
27:53.900 --> 27:55.619
Slow down.

256
27:55.619 --> 27:56.619
Alright.

257
27:59.080 --> 28:01.020
Leave it to me.

258
28:26.800 --> 28:28.759
What are you embroidering?

259
28:28.759 --> 28:30.500
You've been at it all afternoon.

260
28:37.200 --> 28:39.160
I'm making this for Ze Ning.

261
28:39.160 --> 28:41.279
What do you think? Is it good?

262
28:42.799 --> 28:44.500
The kitten is well-embroidered.

263
28:46.880 --> 28:49.200
This isn't a kitten.

264
28:50.520 --> 28:52.873
It's clearly a tiger cub.

265
28:54.240 --> 28:55.840
A tiger cub?

266
28:55.840 --> 29:00.280
I think it's a kitten with its claws out.

267
29:22.280 --> 29:23.821
Just like this one.

268
29:42.840 --> 29:44.819
That bite...

269
29:44.819 --> 29:47.093
You really do act like a kitten.

270
29:59.120 --> 30:01.499
Then you'd better be careful.

271
30:02.880 --> 30:08.100
A kitten... can be as fierce as a tiger.

272
30:20.720 --> 30:22.619
I advise you, my dear,

273
30:23.480 --> 30:25.081
not to play with fire.

274
30:33.440 --> 30:35.279
I am going to play with fire.

275
30:36.200 --> 30:38.000
What are you going to do about it?

276
30:39.720 --> 30:41.901
Are you going to...

277
30:44.319 --> 30:46.920
put me under military discipline, sir?

278
31:11.720 --> 31:13.059
Let go.

279
31:19.980 --> 31:22.726
It seems I need to teach you a lesson.

280
31:25.460 --> 31:26.759
What's wrong?

281
31:28.059 --> 31:29.799
You're hurting me.

282
31:29.799 --> 31:31.059
Where does it hurt?

283
31:40.440 --> 31:42.980
I need to go find Mother. We're playing mahjong and making mooncakes.

284
32:05.596 --> 32:07.280
It looks good, right?

285
32:07.280 --> 32:08.680
Jin Xuan.

286
32:08.680 --> 32:10.380
How does this one look?

287
32:10.380 --> 32:12.400
Not bad. But use less sugar.

288
32:12.400 --> 32:14.500
Father and Mother don't like it too sweet.

289
32:14.500 --> 32:15.819
Alright, I'll eat it.

290
32:15.819 --> 32:16.839
Alright.

291
32:16.839 --> 32:19.900
Ze Ning, look at what they're doing.

292
32:19.900 --> 32:21.119
Look.

293
32:21.119 --> 32:22.440
Ze Ning.

294
32:29.720 --> 32:32.133
- White Dragon. - Good boy, Ze Ning.

295
32:33.680 --> 32:37.040
Bing Wen, what do you think of the Commander's hand?

296
32:43.116 --> 32:45.040
Father's always been a master strategist.

297
32:45.040 --> 32:46.960
A mahjong game is like a battle.

298
32:46.960 --> 32:49.486
- Victory is surely in his hands. - Jin Xuan, look.

299
32:50.160 --> 32:52.160
You think I haven't lost enough?

300
33:01.120 --> 33:04.920
Ping Jun, can't decide what to play again?

301
33:04.920 --> 33:07.480
I think you just need someone standing behind you

302
33:07.480 --> 33:10.320
to give you some pointers.

303
33:10.320 --> 33:11.659
Father, Mother.

304
33:13.420 --> 33:14.720
What a coincidence.

305
33:14.720 --> 33:17.579
Your advisor has arrived.

306
33:22.420 --> 33:24.080
Let Bing Wen play for you.

307
33:24.080 --> 33:25.626
I'll take you out for a walk.

308
33:25.626 --> 33:27.819
You want to leave just because you won?

309
33:27.819 --> 33:29.226
That's not right.

310
33:30.019 --> 33:31.519
Listen to what Father said.

311
33:31.519 --> 33:34.539
Besides, I'm still half a round away.

312
33:34.539 --> 33:35.720
Just go.

313
33:35.720 --> 33:39.240
Someone's mind is already out the door.

314
33:39.240 --> 33:41.220
Then I'll take her with me.

315
33:41.220 --> 33:44.680
If we team up as a couple, who knows how much we'd win from you.

316
33:44.680 --> 33:45.757
Let's go.

317
33:45.757 --> 33:47.339
Mother, I'm off.

318
33:48.220 --> 33:50.740
Bing Wen, take over for her.

319
33:53.120 --> 33:55.240
Chang Xuan, you're so biased.

320
33:55.240 --> 33:57.140
Why don't you take me out too?

321
33:57.140 --> 33:58.480
Just go make your mooncakes.

322
33:58.480 --> 34:00.920
Eat more. Look how thin you've gotten.

323
34:00.920 --> 34:03.240
I told you, don't touch my head again!

324
34:05.279 --> 34:08.039
Ze Ning, look at them. Aren't they funny?

325
34:08.920 --> 34:13.760
- Bravo! - Bravo!

326
34:18.960 --> 34:25.179
- Bravo! - Bravo!

327
34:28.179 --> 34:30.600
- Bravo! - Bravo!

328
34:30.600 --> 34:32.019
Come on, everyone!

329
34:32.019 --> 34:33.760
Come and have a look!

330
34:33.760 --> 34:35.460
Shoot the balloons!

331
34:35.460 --> 34:38.300
Let's see how good this young man's aim is.

332
34:40.200 --> 34:43.360
- Bravo! - Bravo!

333
34:43.360 --> 34:45.239
So close.

334
34:45.239 --> 34:46.820
Aim carefully.

335
34:47.500 --> 34:48.639
Let's see.

336
34:48.639 --> 34:50.059
- The second shot. - You've got this.

337
34:51.280 --> 34:53.759
- He hit it! - Great!

338
34:54.539 --> 34:56.940
This young man has some skills!

339
34:57.760 --> 34:59.053
Take aim.

340
35:01.273 --> 35:02.559
Just a little bit off.

341
35:02.559 --> 35:04.320
- Forget it. Let's go. - He's no good.

342
35:04.320 --> 35:05.800
Wait, I'll think of something.

343
35:06.560 --> 35:11.480
Sir, can I just buy that porcelain doll?

344
35:11.480 --> 35:12.619
Wait.

345
35:12.619 --> 35:15.640
Isn't that cheating?

346
35:15.640 --> 35:17.480
I've had this stall for many years.

347
35:17.480 --> 35:20.579
- We can't break the rules, right? - Yes.

348
35:20.579 --> 35:25.000
Look, if you really like that doll, then play another round.

349
35:25.000 --> 35:27.659
- That's right. - One silver dollar for one round.

350
35:27.659 --> 35:30.480
Five hits out of ten get you a prize.

351
35:30.480 --> 35:35.160
If you get seven hits, you can take away our grand prize, the Lucky Doll.

352
35:35.160 --> 35:36.720
Who else wants to try?

353
35:36.720 --> 35:39.300
One silver dollar for one round. Anyone?

354
35:40.420 --> 35:42.159
What if I hit ten out of ten?

355
35:43.120 --> 35:45.960
Ten out of ten? That's hard.

356
35:45.960 --> 35:50.619
I've run this stall for years, and no one has ever hit all ten shots.

357
35:51.640 --> 35:53.160
Chang Xuan.

358
35:53.160 --> 35:56.440
Sir, if you can hit all ten shots today,

359
35:56.440 --> 35:59.820
you can take all the grand prizes in my stall.

360
35:59.820 --> 36:02.100
- How about that? - Really?

361
36:04.160 --> 36:05.859
See that doll?

362
36:05.859 --> 36:09.800
If we take it back for Ze Ning, he'd probably love it.

363
36:09.800 --> 36:11.780
Then give it a try.

364
36:11.780 --> 36:12.980
I'll try.

365
36:13.619 --> 36:16.420
Alright, let's see this young man's aim.

366
36:16.420 --> 36:18.460
Is it as good as he says?

367
36:19.880 --> 36:21.659
Aim carefully.

368
36:25.560 --> 36:28.726
- He hit it! Amazing! - Impressive.

369
36:33.080 --> 36:35.019
Really? Five hits in a row.

370
36:35.019 --> 36:36.980
Yes, he's amazing!

371
36:38.280 --> 36:40.960
Sir, hold on, please.

372
36:40.960 --> 36:42.600
How about this?

373
36:42.600 --> 36:46.861
If you really like that doll, I'll just give it to you, alright?

374
36:47.520 --> 36:51.860
- That's not what you said just now. - Right.

375
36:51.860 --> 36:53.360
How can we do that?

376
36:53.360 --> 36:56.800
Didn't you say we had to follow the rules?

377
36:56.800 --> 37:00.300
Rules are rules, but we can be flexible, right?

378
37:03.360 --> 37:04.940
- Six! - Six!

379
37:04.940 --> 37:07.119
- Seven! - Seven!

380
37:07.119 --> 37:08.940
- Eight! - Eight!

381
37:09.639 --> 37:11.280
- Nine! - Nine!

382
37:13.840 --> 37:16.239
- Ten! - Ten!

383
37:16.239 --> 37:19.800
- That's amazing! - He's so good!

384
37:19.800 --> 37:21.699
- Incredible! - Impressive!

385
37:21.699 --> 37:22.860
He's a sharpshooter!

386
37:22.860 --> 37:24.920
Yes, he's amazing!

387
37:26.120 --> 37:29.000
Sir, please don't take offense.

388
37:29.000 --> 37:30.713
I run a small business.

389
37:30.713 --> 37:36.080
If you take all of these, I'll lose everything I've put in today.

390
37:36.080 --> 37:38.281
Please have mercy.

391
37:47.099 --> 37:48.400
Thank you.

392
37:49.440 --> 37:50.739
It's so cute.

393
37:53.199 --> 37:54.340
Let's go.

394
37:57.320 --> 37:58.600
Look at them.

395
37:59.520 --> 38:03.801
I didn't expect you to be not only a sharpshooter, but a man of grace.

396
38:10.739 --> 38:12.900
You've only just noticed my virtues?

397
38:21.880 --> 38:23.119
Take your pick.

398
38:31.199 --> 38:32.320
Here you go.

399
39:01.440 --> 39:02.960
See if it's sweet.

400
39:10.800 --> 39:11.800
Is it good?

401
39:13.139 --> 39:14.360
It's very sweet.

402
39:22.400 --> 39:23.539
Hold this.

403
40:09.920 --> 40:12.860
I'm not drying it. I want to sleep.

404
40:25.800 --> 40:29.179
If you don't dry it now, you'll have a headache tomorrow.

405
40:44.679 --> 40:47.260
There, there. It'll be done soon.

406
41:02.920 --> 41:08.079
The injury from the explosion is almost healed.

407
41:13.780 --> 41:15.420
Does it still hurt?

408
41:35.480 --> 41:41.139
This past period of time has felt like a dream.

409
41:42.960 --> 41:47.821
Sometimes I feel like it's not quite real.

410
42:42.159 --> 42:43.719
And now?

411
42:45.920 --> 42:48.199
Does it still feel like a dream?

412
44:15.655 --> 44:16.960
Chang Xuan.

413
44:16.960 --> 44:19.360
The Central Government sent Commissioner Gao to our city.

414
44:19.360 --> 44:20.820
Officially, he's here to inspect our defenses.

415
44:20.820 --> 44:22.679
Who knows what he's really up to.

416
44:23.380 --> 44:28.099
This Gao Ping is the Deputy Director of the Military Affairs Department.

417
44:28.099 --> 44:30.260
I heard he's been in high regard lately.

418
44:30.260 --> 44:36.139
Last month, he was awarded an imported Buick and a personal chauffeur.

419
44:36.139 --> 44:39.680
Moreover, he was given a large mansion.

420
44:39.680 --> 44:43.800
With access to the Prime Minister's Office, his influence has grown significantly.

421
44:43.800 --> 44:47.079
A special envoy who is in the limelight

422
44:48.480 --> 44:50.480
won't be easy to deal with.

423
44:53.500 --> 44:58.080
How about I find an excuse not to receive him?

424
44:58.080 --> 44:59.860
He's already on his way.

425
44:59.860 --> 45:04.739
If we brush him off, the Central Government could accuse us of being disloyal.

426
45:04.739 --> 45:06.199
What should we do then?

427
45:07.659 --> 45:10.039
We'll play it by ear when he arrives.

428
45:10.039 --> 45:12.239
Don't skip any of the proper formalities.

429
45:30.000 --> 45:34.350
Ping Jun, when Commissioner Gao arrives, I'll have to entertain him.

430
45:34.350 --> 45:36.320
Madam Zhang and Madam Gu will be here.

431
45:36.320 --> 45:37.824
They both like you very much.

432
45:37.824 --> 45:40.480
You can have some tea and chat with them.

433
45:40.480 --> 45:42.200
Don't worry.

434
45:44.900 --> 45:49.099
The Commander-in-Chief is currently on a patrol in North Harbor.

435
45:49.099 --> 45:53.160
And now Commissioner Gao has come to Nanhuai.

436
45:53.160 --> 45:57.739
Though it's called an inspection, I'm afraid he has other motives.

437
45:57.739 --> 46:00.900
The Revolutionary Army took several cities.

438
46:00.900 --> 46:05.639
The Central Government must be planning to extort resources from everywhere.

439
46:06.539 --> 46:12.400
Whatever the Central Government's plan is, we must fully support Chang Xuan.

440
46:12.400 --> 46:15.599
Let's handle this Gao first. He's a big shot we can't afford to offend.

441
46:17.980 --> 46:20.699
Commissioner Gao of the Central Government has arrived.

442
46:50.119 --> 46:51.460
Isn't that Jiang Xue Ting?

443
46:51.460 --> 46:52.460
Yes, it is.
